      "updated": 1767850462390,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Update the File Status (Processing)\n2. Get the Processor Class according to fileType\n3. Processor.process(\"dummy-content\")\n4. Update the File Status to Completed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Update the File Status (Processing)\n2. Get the Processor Class according to fileType\n3. Processor.process(\"dummy-content\")\n4. Update the File Status to Completed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
