      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1767851159954,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Customer Agent Support System\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Customer can initiate a chat with the CSR\n- Chat Request comes to available CSR\n- CSR should be able to reply with 4mins\n- Customer and CSR can have long chat session \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Customer Agent Support System\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Customer can initiate a chat with the CSR\n- Chat Request comes to available CSR\n- CSR should be able to reply with 4mins\n- Customer and CSR can have long chat session \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
